<title>SWEDEN: Sweden PM says to spend 10 bln Skr on environment.</title>
<headline>Sweden PM says to spend 10 bln Skr on environment.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Prime Minister Goran Persson said on Friday his minority Social Democratic government intended to invest 10 billion crowns over three years on environmental measures.</p>
<p>&quot;We will invest 10 billion crowns over three years to build an ecologically sustainable Sweden,&quot; Persson told a seminar. &quot;This is not new money, but a question of how to reshuffle it from other areas.&quot;</p>
</text>
